    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 8 ('The Bat Cave! (the live dungeon: bats from the miners' platforms down through th'): scene sh_bat_cave, 6 groups standing at the start, 1 coming later, the boss Echolyss, the Bat King last; every spot is the fork's."
